WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.727 --> 00:00:01.769
MANTIS
It sounds like Christmas is

00:00:01.819 --> 00:00:05.848
a wonderful time, and Peter's so sad
about Gamora being gone.

00:00:06.586 --> 00:00:11.078
Maybe if we gave Peter a really wonderful
Christmas gift, it would make him happy.

00:00:11.789 --> 00:00:13.280
KORTOLBOOKALIA
One, two, three, four!

00:00:13.336 --> 00:00:18.362
♫ Ho ho ho ho ho
Earthlings are so weird ♫

00:00:18.412 --> 00:00:19.069
GROOT
I am Groot!

00:00:19.914 --> 00:00:20.883
DRAX
Kevin Bacon!

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:23.031
You're coming with us
as a Christmas present.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.928
♫ Christmastime is here ♫

